# Acct 2 owns orders 1 and 3 in the sweep path and order 6 beyond the limit.
N 1 1 2 S LMT GTC 0 CN 100 2
N 2 2 1 S LMT GTC 0 CN 100 3
N 3 3 2 S LMT GTC 0 CN 101 4
N 4 4 1 S LMT GTC 0 CN 101 1
N 5 5 1 S LMT GTC 0 CN 103 6
N 6 6 2 S LMT GTC 0 CN 103 1
# Acct 2 buys 6 @101, cancel-oldest: own orders 1 and 3 are cancelled as they are reached,
# 3 + 1 fills, and the remaining 2 rests @101. Order 6 is beyond the limit and untouched.
N 7 7 2 B LMT GTC 0 CO 101 6
